# Note: This code is purely AI-generated.
# Every build carried: `net/Makefile:24: CC cannot link executables. Skipping bpfilter.` - emitted
# unconditionally, even though CONFIG_BPFILTER is NOT SET in this kernel (verified in the built .config).
# A notice about skipping a feature nobody asked for is noise, and noise is what made a HARD module-signing
# defect invisible among 218 lines in build 14. The message is now gated on CONFIG_BPFILTER, so it appears
# only when bpfilter is actually wanted and the compiler genuinely cannot build it - where it is actionable.
diff --git a/kernel/realme/sm6150/net/Makefile b/kernel/realme/sm6150/net/Makefile
